\f1\fs28 Meerkateer Controller Developer Preview notice\f0\fs20\par
\par
Please read this notice before installing or connecting a computer.\par
\par
\b 1. Developer Preview.\b0  This Controller is pre-release software. Interfaces, configuration, package formats, and behavior may change before Meerkateer 1.0.\par
\par
\b 2. No warranty.\b0  The software is provided under the Apache License 2.0 on an AS IS basis, without warranties or conditions of any kind. This notice does not replace or modify the Apache License 2.0.\par
\par
\b 3. Unsigned preview package.\b0  This direct-download preview is not code-signed. Download it only from the official Meerkateer GitHub release and verify the adjacent SHA-256 checksum before installation.\par
\par
\b 4. Administrative changes.\b0  Installation requires administrator authority. Setup creates a protected local configuration containing a machine credential and registers a background Windows startup task.\par
\par
\b 5. Outbound telemetry.\b0  After enrollment, the Controller sends a mandatory heartbeat and only the CPU, memory, disk totals, and exact process-running signals selected during setup to the Meerkateer API address entered by the operator. Review the destination and signal allowlist before connecting.\par
\par
\b 6. Operator responsibility.\b0  Install only on computers you are authorized to administer. Protect the Meerkateer API with HTTPS, firewall rules, access controls, backups, and normal operating-system security. Do not expose a preview installation directly to untrusted networks.\par
\par
\b 7. No remote shell.\b0  This preview opens outbound connections only and does not provide an arbitrary remote shell or accept arbitrary remote commands.\par
\par
By continuing, you confirm that you are authorized to administer this computer, have reviewed the destination and collected signals, and understand these Developer Preview risks.\par
